    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for any modifiable element contained within a terrain cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="class_cell_element" kindref="compound">CellElement</ref> represents a component of a <ref refid="class_terrain_cell" kindref="compound">TerrainCell</ref> that can be modified by environmental patches (moisture, resources, obstacles, habitat domain, etc.). Each element stores a patch priority indicating whether a new patch is allowed to overwrite the current state. Derived classes implement the actual element behaviour, while <ref refid="class_cell_element" kindref="compound">CellElement</ref> manages patch priority and serialization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
